Error.kt (added ErrorCode enum value), ShipmentControllerTest.kt (added tests and import)\n\n**Diff review:**\n\n| File | Change | Necessity |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| `api/ApiError.kt` | Added `SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE` to ErrorCode enum | Required for semantic correctness of 409 response when confirming CANCELLED shipment (criterion #4) |\n| `shipment/ShipmentController.kt` | Added `@PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")` method with when-expression over ShipmentStatus | Required to implement the new endpoint as per ticket requirement |\n| `shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt` | Added 4 new test methods covering all cases; added import for content matcher | Required to satisfy acceptance criteria #2, #3, #5 with test coverage |\n\n**Unresolved findings:** None. All acceptance criteria are satisfied and tests verify the behavior.\n\n```\n<<PHASE:DONE>>\n```\n\nRequirement   Add idempotent `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm` endpoint that transitions CREATED shipments to CONFIRMED, succeeds on retry, rejects CANCELLED shipments with 409, and returns 404 for missing shipments.\n\nChanged       \n  api/ApiError.kt — Added SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE ErrorCode to support semantic error responses for invalid state transitions\n  shipment/ShipmentController.kt — Added confirm endpoint with when-expression handling all three shipment states\n  shipment/ShipmentControllerTest.kt — Added 4 new tests covering CREATED→CONFIRMED transition, idempotent confirmation, CANCELLED rejection, and 404 case\n\nTests         \n  \"confirms a CREATED shipment to CONFIRMED status\" — exercises the main success path, verifies state transition and persistence\n  \"confirms an already CONFIRMED shipment succeeds and changes nothing\" — verifies idempotency for retry safety\n  \"rejects confirming a CANCELLED shipment with 409\" — verifies business logic constraint with correct error code\n  \"rejects confirming a non-existent shipment with 404\" — verifies missing resource handling with